            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>One of the key advantages of the Partner Box 3 is its app-based connectivity, allowing partners to control each other’s devices from across the room—or across the world. Through the Satisfyer Connect app, users can access editable preset programs, create unlimited vibration patterns, and enjoy discreet whisper-quiet operation.<br/><br/>Backed by a 15-year guarantee, equipped with powerful deep vibrations, and designed for effortless hygiene and convenience, the Partner Box 3 offers exceptional value and versatility. It’s a complete pleasure set built for couples who want flexibility, intimacy, and modern control in one elegant package.</p>",
